{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52543","headline":"其二 · 陈元光","name":"其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤云悦我心，一点通神意。\n流泉濯巨灵，深谷豁神智。\n魈魅神之兵，黎庶神所庇。\n精气烛彼天，名山妥灵地。\n岭表开崇祠，辽东建神帜。\n六字动天威，九重颁岁祭。\n相期翊国忠，我舆三神契。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}